        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A TRULY WONDERFUL 3 BED / 1 BATH SEMI DETACHED FAMILY HOME WITH CONSERVATORY AND SOUTH FACING GARDEN SITUATED IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER MATURE SETTLED NEIGHBOURHOOD OF BLAKESTOWN IN CLONSILLA DUBLIN 15\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING IS STRONGLY RECOMMENDED ...\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin 15 Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 4 Blakestown Road to the Clonsilla property market. Blakestown is an extremely popular suburb of superior family homes. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nA private driveway welcomes you to this superb family home. No. 4 will no doubt appeal to first time buyers, investors and parties trading up / downsizing alike. No expense has been spared on the high end finish of this premium house. This beautiful property has been very tastefully decorated and extremely well maintained so it is in walk in immaculate condition throughout. \r\n\r\nThe floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining room, and sunroom / conservatory. Upstairs there is a landing, 3 bedrooms, a family bathroom and hot press. \r\n\r\nThe bright and airy living room features an ornate fireplace and boasts top grade flooring. The spacious attractive kitchen / dining room is flooded with natural light. The kitchen features crisp grey designer units with an abundance of worktop space. Added to this there is a cute breakfast bar and extensive storage space. A real bonus of this exceptional home is the stunning conservatory at the rear which offers an ideal additional living space. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there are three good sized double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes. The gorgeous modern family bathroom is fully tiled with top quality sanitary ware. *Please note this energy efficient property has triple glazing throughout and a gas fired heating system. The large sunny back garden offers a perfect space to relax or entertain. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none within a 25 minute drive of Dublin International Airport. The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is within easy reach. There are many recreational and sports amenities literally on your doorstep. Leisure activities including National Aquatic Centre and Sports Campus Ireland are in the Dublin 15 locality. Dublin 15's Corporate Parks and Connolly Hospital are also close by. Both Blanchardstown and Castleknock Villages are within less than a ten minute drive. Also The Phoenix Park is nearby. The property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. Ideally both Clonsilla and Castleknock Train Stations are nearby. The area is further serviced by an excellent bus service making the city most accessible. The M50 and M3 Motorways are also close to hand making this a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended…\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
